# Trivy ignore list
# ==================
# Each entry documents the CVE, the package affected, the reason for the
# suppression, and a review-by date so the decision is revisited.
#
# Format:
# CVE-ID [optional: package@version] [optional: expiry YYYY-MM-DD]
#   Reason: <justification>

# Example (commented):
# CVE-2023-12345  pkg:golang/github.com/example/lib@v1.0.0  2025-06-01
#   Reason: Only exploitable with physical access; fix waiting on upstream release.
